{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:93bb6bbe9882918eaba29150ba7269424629d4f7fdee36b93a40d6ad5c660b4c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5ff2182af8d473f98cc53787616a77ea31b25f21f65609ba725e15c37a44d3d",
      "text": "因为是大家一起写出的歌",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb5cc1e4195e623aa30de3a1e4739dc472d15eb3850233107b01bade1a4f3d89",
      "text": "唔——……契合全员曲风格的演出啊～\n什么样的比较好呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d67152b03e4a489bfe1c91e3e6c6526eb0cee768be5c69569623d4a4c8c2cd3",
      "text": "目标范围是缩窄了。虽说以为会更容易些，\n但每个人从主题中感受到的印象都不尽相同。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b789d40f9f2e5fa276de0b8da7734e20ec66216bd1f8b1162f7c6073e008b1",
      "text": "看来首先还是要把这些归纳一下才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb0cf3eaad9723902cd26a001356249a1f4c97df75be957d094790a56838d638",
      "text": "那么运用灯光来展现大海如何？\n如果是大海的话，可以表达各种各样的情感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20e9c4823dbccf4a5a9ebb3f557944af55b6fb8f4e59f31a4a395ce18c326d9b",
      "text": "那样固然不错，但多考虑能让人感受到其他组合\n元素的演出会不会更好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82747c7ff45830e033ab7432c57e488e0ebce062645bb873ef2a91f7d9fe9bf1",
      "text": "确实呢～可是有这么多个组合在，\n统合起来好像会很不容易呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35b4b93a8cc4b97ac84af6c501805dad1289d9337ecd0df91bf71a2d74e0df2",
      "text": "重新读一遍新歌的歌词如何。\n因为各个组合的特色都被极其出色地展现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7a053e4c7a54437f9416918d741c2e974ca0a3a6375b4ee0772ccd2e3ebbb7",
      "text": "确实……那份歌词很有参考价值呢～\n毕竟是大家集思广益写出来的歌嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e76592c3085ce60fd735e17fc504e8411d0d3f3b83def223c71c87c0f6ea537",
      "text": "试着把各自在意的要点写出来看看吧。\n说不定能找到什么头绪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:568482170adc8b3eaa75c4d2c1ecdaa37f4495a9f703b39b7c8191713f8364ef",
      "text": "还有，要不去跟其他人也商量看看呢～？\n明天不是和DRAMATIC STARS在同一个现场吗～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_008_22_5_06_008_22:5_06_008_22:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e35e10031a8014d17b26fa5bc15016263c35d7bee88e42f718fce51cd124d8",
      "text": "那真是个好主意！\n那么，我们现在就把商讨的内容汇总一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
